title: "Tuning a prime race to one prime power"
abstract: "Under Dirichlet GRH, variable-width prime-race extrema isolate individual prime powers and have a sharp two-term curvature cusp. Without GRH the band formula and the cusp expansion hold for the explicit-formula sum over zeros."
